# Normalize line endings: LF in the repo and in every checkout. Windows runners
# otherwise check out CRLF and gofmt/golangci-lint reject the files.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
# cmd.exe misreads labels in a batch file with bare LF line ends.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
# The Claude Code plugin is stored and checked out byte for byte: claude.ai's
# plugin directory refuses a repository whose attributes would change what a
# checkout of the plugin holds. The Windows launcher is committed with CRLF.
plugins/** -text
